---
description: Every UI component ships with all of its states, not just the happy path
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.jsx"]
alwaysApply: false
---

When building or changing a component:
- Build empty, loading, error and success states, not just the filled-in one.
- Every interactive element has hover, focus-visible, pressed and disabled styles. Focus must be visible.
- Test with very long text, very short text and missing images.
- Buttons say what they do ("Save changes"), and the same action keeps the same name in toasts and confirmations.
- Error messages say what happened and what to do next. No "Something went wrong".
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion for anything that moves.
